{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Apocalypse Survivors",
    "steam_appid": 3481040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/4f45e483263098d19cefcf756e62624e.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this age of a global viral outbreak, you are the next generation human of the \u201cAlpha\u201d Project, the hope for humanity's future. You are deployed to the frontlines of the zombie tide to reignite the hope of human survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/d5b4b628a106fb5802e40441b25c9fe9.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lengthy storylines, no repetitive cutscenes. Step into this adventurous post-apocalyptic world. Choose your favorite character and pick up your preferred weapon! This is a game everyone will enjoy. Whether you're experienced or new to gaming, simply move, choose, and decide to experience the recurring joy of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/1c12c35d74e0a58bb4f26c17a42a446a.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone hero, equipped with various talents and support skills. You can either focus on your favorite character to change their gear and unlock their ultimate abilities. How you combine your equipment and find your own preferred playstyle will be the challenge this post-apocalyptic world presents to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/2f879c78fd4e075366cf7ad5c8c95746.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a stoic warrior. He specializes in using katanas, pistols, and assault rifles. By traveling through a rift in time and space, he has gained dark powers, allowing him to wield unique moves with his katana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/76e8ec53319fbcaf38a6a591ff453244.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a wild warrior.and the grenade launcher is his favorite. Only he can use this heavy weapon, and his physical enhancement allows him to fire it in rapid succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/938c909144c266ffeecb6509289d5abb.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is agile and quick, excelling at launching surprise attacks. Proficient with daggers and automatic rapid-fire pistols, she is a highly-trained assassin whose specialty is throwing all kinds of throwing knives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a6ffcfac01f6db973fb7b7fe68e44398.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is exceptionally talented, possessing strength and a desire for conquest that surpasses that of men. She specializes in using revolvers and sniper rifles. Additionally, she knows how to use two revolvers simultaneously, and after her body is enhanced, she can fire a rapid round at all surrounding enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/974ecedd20c70e6c0a493744b47affac.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery Store:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Players can purchase equipment with random attributes through a mysterious figure. The quality of the equipment improves as the difficulty level of the game is increased. With sufficient currency, players can obtain better equipment, which gradually helps to enhance their progress in clearing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c97e6c7d2f5c4691e220495f31f489d.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip Manufacturing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Players can manufacture chips that enhance attributes. These chips can be equipped onto weapons, significantly boosting the character's attributes. This makes character development much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/37d49b6e71a5e186c57d53f4c7d55e1f.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Modification:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Players can modify equipment using specific items. Equipment can not only be drilled for sockets but also have their other attributes enhanced. When players obtain the desired equipment, they can purposefully upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/b02f0764781b526246bdf74892145715.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Players can create multiple characters and can also change the names of these characters. By creating multiple characters, players can use their talents to allow these saved characters to follow the main character in battle and fight zombies in a random manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a1a6da103d74a53eb3bcf2918235bfd6.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Each character can fill up their talent tree. Talent points are earned from completing tasks, killing zombies, collecting boxes, and purchasing items. The talents of different characters will vary slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c527afd85b28fdcb6cb7d43693573e2.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/ca02fcb00b461d78e1663e5935717105.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially, we were a small team of close friends who wanted to create the kind of gameplay we loved and share it with everyone. Although my friends are still supporting me, the team has now become just me. However, I don\u2019t see this as a sad thing. It has truly become an independent development effort. Over the past few months, I\u2019ve continued to maintain my initial passion and gradually improved the game. I will keep developing it. I believe this won\u2019t be my last independent game, and I will continue to create more games in the future. If you have any ideas about the direction of my game design, we look forward to your feedback on my Discord. If you are interested in this game, please add it to your watch list and wishlist\u2014it means a lot to me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/4f45e483263098d19cefcf756e62624e.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this age of a global viral outbreak, you are the next generation human of the \u201cAlpha\u201d Project, the hope for humanity's future. You are deployed to the frontlines of the zombie tide to reignite the hope of human survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/d5b4b628a106fb5802e40441b25c9fe9.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lengthy storylines, no repetitive cutscenes. Step into this adventurous post-apocalyptic world. Choose your favorite character and pick up your preferred weapon! This is a game everyone will enjoy. Whether you're experienced or new to gaming, simply move, choose, and decide to experience the recurring joy of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/1c12c35d74e0a58bb4f26c17a42a446a.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone hero, equipped with various talents and support skills. You can either focus on your favorite character to change their gear and unlock their ultimate abilities. How you combine your equipment and find your own preferred playstyle will be the challenge this post-apocalyptic world presents to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/2f879c78fd4e075366cf7ad5c8c95746.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a stoic warrior. He specializes in using katanas, pistols, and assault rifles. By traveling through a rift in time and space, he has gained dark powers, allowing him to wield unique moves with his katana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/76e8ec53319fbcaf38a6a591ff453244.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a wild warrior.and the grenade launcher is his favorite. Only he can use this heavy weapon, and his physical enhancement allows him to fire it in rapid succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/938c909144c266ffeecb6509289d5abb.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is agile and quick, excelling at launching surprise attacks. Proficient with daggers and automatic rapid-fire pistols, she is a highly-trained assassin whose specialty is throwing all kinds of throwing knives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a6ffcfac01f6db973fb7b7fe68e44398.avif?t=1752518258\" width=312 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is exceptionally talented, possessing strength and a desire for conquest that surpasses that of men. She specializes in using revolvers and sniper rifles. Additionally, she knows how to use two revolvers simultaneously, and after her body is enhanced, she can fire a rapid round at all surrounding enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/974ecedd20c70e6c0a493744b47affac.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery Store:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Players can purchase equipment with random attributes through a mysterious figure. The quality of the equipment improves as the difficulty level of the game is increased. With sufficient currency, players can obtain better equipment, which gradually helps to enhance their progress in clearing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c97e6c7d2f5c4691e220495f31f489d.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip Manufacturing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Players can manufacture chips that enhance attributes. These chips can be equipped onto weapons, significantly boosting the character's attributes. This makes character development much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/37d49b6e71a5e186c57d53f4c7d55e1f.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Modification:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Players can modify equipment using specific items. Equipment can not only be drilled for sockets but also have their other attributes enhanced. When players obtain the desired equipment, they can purposefully upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/b02f0764781b526246bdf74892145715.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Players can create multiple characters and can also change the names of these characters. By creating multiple characters, players can use their talents to allow these saved characters to follow the main character in battle and fight zombies in a random manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/a1a6da103d74a53eb3bcf2918235bfd6.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Each character can fill up their talent tree. Talent points are earned from completing tasks, killing zombies, collecting boxes, and purchasing items. The talents of different characters will vary slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/9c527afd85b28fdcb6cb7d43693573e2.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481040/extras/ca02fcb00b461d78e1663e5935717105.avif?t=1752518258\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially, we were a small team of close friends who wanted to create the kind of gameplay we loved and share it with everyone. Although my friends are still supporting me, the team has now become just me. However, I don\u2019t see this as a sad thing. It has truly become an independent development effort. Over the past few months, I\u2019ve continued to maintain my initial passion and gradually improved the game. I will keep developing it. I believe this won\u2019t be my last independent game, and I will continue to create more games in the future. If you have any ideas about the direction of my game design, we look forward to your feedback on my Discord. If you are interested in this game, please add it to your watch list and wishlist\u2014it means a lot to me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
